Package: kbdata
Title: Access Data from the Royal Danish Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("KUB Datalab", email = "kubdatalab@kb.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Search and retrieve aerial photographs, digital collection
    metadata, and literary texts from the Royal Danish Library. Return
    analysis-ready data frames, JSON responses, and XML documents.
